graph TD
    %% Global Nodes
    ONBOARD[🚀 Onboarding: Precinct Setup]:::onboard
    REEL[📰 View 1: Civic Reel & Pulse Wire]:::feed
    MATRIX[⚖️ View 2: Decision Matrix]:::matrix
    BALLOT[🗳️ View 3: Precision Ballot]:::ballot
    RADAR[📡 View 4: Civic Radar & Districts]:::radar
    DRAWER[📋 Candidate Dossier Drawer]:::drawer
    SOUND_MODAL[🔊 Debate Audio Soundbite Modal]:::modal
    PASS_MODAL[📱 Offline Booth Reference Pass]:::pass
    LOGISTICS[ℹ️ MI Voter Action & ID Rules Hub]:::system

    %% Transitions
    ONBOARD -->|"Tap 'Continue to VoterLens'"| REEL
    ONBOARD -->|"Tap sample precinct"| BALLOT

    %% Nav bar transitions between 4 views
    REEL <-->|"Nav: Matrix"| MATRIX
    REEL <-->|"Nav: Ballot"| BALLOT
    REEL <-->|"Nav: Radar"| RADAR
    MATRIX <-->|"Nav: Ballot"| BALLOT
    MATRIX <-->|"Nav: Radar"| RADAR
    BALLOT <-->|"Nav: Radar"| RADAR

    %% Deep interactions
    REEL -->|"Tap candidate chip"| DRAWER
    REEL -->|"Tap audio waveform"| SOUND_MODAL
    REEL -->|"Tap 'Compare in Matrix'"| MATRIX

    MATRIX -->|"Tap candidate column header"| DRAWER
    MATRIX -->|"Tap 'Select for Ballot'"| BALLOT

    BALLOT -->|"Tap 'Export Booth Pass'"| PASS_MODAL
    BALLOT -->|"Tap 'ID & Polling Info'"| LOGISTICS
    BALLOT -->|"Tap candidate row details"| DRAWER

    RADAR -->|"Tap candidate alignment point"| MATRIX
    RADAR -->|"Tap district card"| REEL

    DRAWER -->|"Close / Swipe Down"| REEL
    SOUND_MODAL -->|"Close / Audio Done"| REEL
    PASS_MODAL -->|"Save to Wallet / Close"| BALLOT
    LOGISTICS -->|"Close"| BALLOT

